{"title": "Incorporeal Movement", "pageid": 21772, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Incorporeal_Movement", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Escape_the_Horde.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Escape_the_Horde.webp/300px-Escape_the_Horde.webp, /w/images/5/5d/Escape_the_Horde.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Escape_the_Horde.webp/300px-Escape_the_Horde.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Escape_the_Horde.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Incorporeal Movement</b> is a passive feature available to <a href=\"/wiki/Ghost\" title=\"Ghost\">Ghosts</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Poltergeist\" title=\"Poltergeist\">Poltergeists</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Opportunity attacks against you have <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_a_Lost_Love\" title=\"Echo of a Lost Love\">Echo of a Lost Love</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Abazigal\" title=\"Echo of Abazigal\">Echo of Abazigal</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Amelyssan\" title=\"Echo of Amelyssan\">Echo of Amelyssan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Illasera\" title=\"Echo of Illasera\">Echo of Illasera</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Echo_of_Sendai\" title=\"Echo of Sendai\">Echo of Sendai</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Feeble_Spectre\" title=\"Feeble Spectre\">Feeble Spectre</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ghislev\" title=\"Ghislev\">Ghislev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gordis\" title=\"Gordis\">Gordis</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Mundane_Spectre\" title=\"Mundane Spectre\">Mundane Spectre</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Phantasm\" title=\"Phantasm\">Phantasm</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Pol\" title=\"Pol\">Pol</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Poltergeist\" title=\"Poltergeist\">Poltergeist</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Primordial_Spectre\" title=\"Primordial Spectre\">Primordial Spectre</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris%27_Mental_Image\" title=\"Ptaris' Mental Image\">Ptaris' Mental Image</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Rocky\" title=\"Rocky\">Rocky</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tormented_Soul\" title=\"Tormented Soul\">Tormented Soul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Tribunal_Ghost\" title=\"Tribunal Ghost\">Tribunal Ghost</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Vengeful_Soul\" title=\"Vengeful Soul\">Vengeful Soul</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Zina\" title=\"Zina\">Zina</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202007\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.030 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 453/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1507/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 799/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 10/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1411/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643678/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   26.533      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   26.533      1 -total\n 36.25%    9.617      1 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 16.84%    4.468      1 Template:PageSeo\n 15.81%    4.196      1 Template:Passive_creatures_list\n 15.72%    4.171      1 Template:Hidden_code\n 13.27%    3.520      1 T